d designed to make skill-building fun and accessible for all learners.\n\nFloreo offers evidence-based immersive lessons widely used in autism education and support settings. These lessons promote exploration, communication, and confidence in a safe and engaging virtual environment.\n\nThe standalone Floreo app includes two calming sensory spaces\u2014an interactive aquarium and a glowing crystal cave\u2014ideal for relaxation, focus, and sensory exploration.\n\nOrganizations can pair Floreo with a coaching device (such as a computer) to unlock our full library of over 175 immersive lessons. Floreo is used in schools, therapy programs, and homes to create meaningful learning opportunities and shared experiences.", "short_description": "Build real-world skills in a virtual world!\nFloreo offers evidence-based VR lessons widely used in autism education and support settings to promote learning, connection, and confidence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://floreovr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://floreovr.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Floreo", "support_website_url": "https://floreovr.com/learning-center/faq", "website_url": "https://floreovr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25695743710092665"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image":